OL,3,APrince Harry and Meghan to arrive in UK
OL,4,Atoday
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are
OL,7,Farriving back in the UK today, BBC News
OL,8,Funderstands.
OL,10,FPrince Harry, Meghan and their children
OL,11,FArchie and Lilibet are believed to be
OL,12,Fflying into the country privately from
OL,13,FCalifornia.
OL,15,FA spokesman for the Duke and Duchess of
OL,16,FSussex said "this is not something we
OL,17,Fwould comment on".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
