OL,3,AAt least 14 babies die in Pakistan
OL,4,Ahospital fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 14 newborn babies have died in
OL,7,Fa fire on a hospital ward in Pakistan's
OL,8,Fcapital Islamabad.
OL,10,FThe fire broke out on the third floor
OL,11,Fof the mother and child unit of the
OL,12,FPakistan Institute of Medical Sciences
OL,13,F(PIMS) hospital, one of the main
OL,14,Fstate-run hospitals in the city, on
OL,15,FWednesday morning.
OL,17,FAn air conditioning unit caught fire, a
OL,18,Fspokesman for the hospital told the
OL,19,FBBC.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
