OL,3,AAt least 14 babies die in Pakistan
OL,4,Ahospital fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were 15 babies in the ward when
OL,7,Fthe fire broke out, a hospital
OL,8,Fspokesman said. One baby was rescued.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
